# Build this file by concatenating the relevant templates from
# https://github.com/github/gitignore (e.g., Python, Node, R, Hugo,
# Quarto, Jupyter, macOS, IDE editors) followed by project-specific
# entries below.

# Local machine-specific config (always ignored)
.env.local
.claude/settings.local.json
/_repos/

# Short-lived local intake folder. Contents are ignored because incoming files
# may be sensitive, large, generated, prior versions, or raw data. Keep only the
# README tracked.
/_inbox/*
!/_inbox/README.md

# Optional per-machine symlink to a Box, Drive, raw-data, private-data, or other
# external root. Configure the root in .env.local and document it in
# .env.local.example.
/_data
/_data/

# Project-specific generated outputs (add after adoption):
